        "original_id": "08a8cf22-54d4-59d0-bfd0-4580831fdc36",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Backpacker murders\n- People: Ivan Milat\n- Places: New South Wales, Australia; Belanglo State Forest; Berrima\n- Organizations: New South Wales Government\n\nFacts:\n- The Backpacker murders were a series of serial killings committed by Ivan Milat in New South Wales, Australia, between 1989 and 1993.\n- The bodies of seven missing young people aged 19 to 22 were found partially buried in Belanglo State Forest, 15 km southwest of Berrima in New South Wales.\n- Belanglo State Forest is owned by the New South Wales Government and contains some of the earliest pine plantings in New South Wales.",
